=2 Walkthrough
* Unequip all of your weapons (including shields) and examine the {p:Veridical Conflux} at **Witchfire Glen** in {z:Grauberg (S)} at (F-5) for a cutscene.
** Use the {p:Survival Guide} to travel to {z:Grauberg (S)}, or take the Campaign warp to {z:Grauberg (S)} and run NW to (F-5).
*** The C.A (Campaign Arbiter) Warp will bring you closest to reach {p:Witchfire Glen} for this objective if you have little to no progress with {p:Voidwatch}.
** Shortcut If you have completed the {p:Voidwatch} quest {q:Glimmer of Hope|Glimmer of Hope|Glimmer of Hope}:
*** Use a {p:Survival Guide} to travel to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)}.
*** Enter {p:Walk of Echoes} via the {p:Veridical Conflux} (J-9).
*** Activate the center Conflux in this area of the Walk to quickly teleport to Witchfire Glen in {z:Grauberg (S)}.
** If you have obtained the {@k} {k:Lightsworm} and are currently on an RoV mission involving the {p:Walk of Echoes}, you may use any blue **???** near the {p:Cavernous Maws|Cavernous Maw} surrounding Jeuno (past or present) to zone in as a shortcut. (Unfortunately, this may not work if you are on {M:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 2-18 (Somber Dreams)|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 2-18|Somber Dreams}. See the {k:Lightsworm} page for additional details.)

